tech stack PWA, Simple react based
tagline: plan your target, we will push you to achieve it
name: Target Planner
database: local storage with optional Firebase/Supabase sync

plan: to have a simple interface for users to plan your target date and purchase items with a simple interface. The app will allow users to create and manage their plans easily, with the ability to add notes and photos for better organization.

plan category:
    date based planning: title, description, target date, notes, photo(optional), reminder (optional)
    purchase planning: name, link, price, range, quantity (default 1), notes, photo(optional), purchase date (optional)
    simplest ui to allow users to quickly add and view their plans without unnecessary clutter. The interface will be intuitive, with clear navigation and easy-to-use forms for adding new plans.


Optional direct-browser cloud sync using Firebase Realtime Database or Supabase.
No custom backend or self-hosted database is required.

On opening the app, compare the local content hash, remote hash, and last synced hash.
Push local-only changes, pull remote-only changes, and ask the user to resolve concurrent changes.
Use the same data_id and provider account on each device.
Connection settings and session credentials stay in local browser storage and are excluded from backups.
Show frontend configuration fields with provider-specific URL/key placeholders.
